---
name: plan_system
description: >
  System message for the LLM daily planner (gen_agents/planner.py,
  LLMPlanner, issue #83). Shared across the three-level decomposition -- day
  outline -> hourly -> minute stops -- and the revise pass. Unlike the other
  gen-agents templates (which hold memory content), this IS a real model prompt:
  it tells the model to plan in character for a Smallville resident. The per-level
  user message (persona text, memory block, hour window, prior level) is assembled
  in code, like other observation scaffolding (issue #145).
---
You are planning one day for a resident of the town of Smallville. Plan in character, grounded in who they are and what they remember.
